      "retweeted_tweet_id": null,
      "text": "INTERDICTED OFF FLORIDA COAST! On July 30, Marine Interdiction Agents from the Miami Marine Unit, with support from partner agencies, interdicted a vessel attempting to unlawfully enter the United States from the direction of The Bahamas. Eight aliens, with nationalities from Ireland and the United Kingdom, were apprehended and transferred to the USCG Cutter Bernard C. Webber for processing and repatriation. A U.S. citizen, was turned over to Homeland Security Investigations for further investigation.\n\nAMO remains committed to protecting America’s maritime borders and working alongside our federal, state, and local partners to disrupt human smuggling.",
      "text_resolved": "INTERDICTED OFF FLORIDA COAST! On July 30, Marine Interdiction Agents from the Miami Marine Unit, with support from partner agencies, interdicted a vessel attempting to unlawfully enter the United States from the direction of The Bahamas. Eight aliens, with nationalities from Ireland and the United Kingdom, were apprehended and transferred to the USCG Cutter Bernard C. Webber for processing and repatriation. A U.S. citizen, was turned over to Homeland Security Investigations for further investigation.\n\nAMO remains committed to protecting America’s maritime borders and working alongside our federal, state, and local partners to disrupt human smuggling.",
