      "text": "🐾🦴Paws for snacks, ready for duty! Yesterday’s “Paws for Snacks” event was a great reminder of how important Raja and Chaplain Richards, AMO’s Critical Incident Response K9 team is to CBP. Raja brings comfort, support, and a steady presence during challenging moments, helping strengthen morale and resilience when it matters most. We’re grateful for this team and the important role they play every day for our workforce. Let’s show them some love.",
      "text_resolved": "🐾🦴Paws for snacks, ready for duty! Yesterday’s “Paws for Snacks” event was a great reminder of how important Raja and Chaplain Richards, AMO’s Critical Incident Response K9 team is to CBP. Raja brings comfort, support, and a steady presence during challenging moments, helping strengthen morale and resilience when it matters most. We’re grateful for this team and the important role they play every day for our workforce. Let’s show them some love.",
